  "statement_html": "<div class=\"color1\">On considère les deux ensembles suivants&nbsp;:\t<ul><li>\\(A\\) = {3,16,17}</li>\t    <li> \\(B\\) = {1,3,6,13,14,15,16,18} </li></ul>\t</div>\t<div class=\"wims_question\">\tCochez toutes les propriétés satisfaites par ces ensembles&nbsp;:\t<ul>  <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> \\(A\\) = \\(B\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> \\(A \\subseteq B\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> \\(B \\subseteq A\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> \\(A\\cap B=\\emptyset\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"5\" /> \\(A\\cap B\\neq \\emptyset\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"6\" /> \\(A\\setminus B\\neq \\emptyset\\)</label></li> <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"7\" /> \\(B\\setminus A\\neq \\emptyset\\)</label></li> </ul>\t</div>",
